<div class="phead"><div class="wrap"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Home</a></li><li>Customers</li></ol><p class="kick">Customer stories (fictional companies)</p><h1>API companies that bill on usage</h1><p class="lede">Four invented customers, four pricing models — per call, per row, per minute and per active device — and what changed when the invoice could explain itself.</p></div></div>
<section class="sec tight"><div class="wrap"><div class="stories">{% for s in Target.Items %}{%- assign x=s.PublishedContent -%}<a class="story" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ s.RoutePath }}"><div class="met"><div><p class="kick">{{ s.PrimaryField }} · {{ x.industry }}</p><h3 style="font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:16px">{{ x.headline }}</h3><div class="big">{{ x.metric_value }}</div><p class="muted" style="margin:8px 0 0">{{ x.metric_label }}</p></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0" class="mono muted">Read the story →</p></div><img src="{{ x.image.Value | attachment_redirect_url }}" alt=""></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
